      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Two equivalent-criterion programs replace direct zero location by different objects: Mellin analysis converts global growth of a smoothed Mobius-weighted function into holomorphic reach, while Jensen transformation converts completed-zeta Taylor packets into an infinite hierarchy of finite real-rootedness tests. Neither representation makes the uniform RH burden finite.",
